on></figure><figure><img alt=\"最近Threads上竟出現一款「蟑螂生日蛋糕」不只把小強還原得超逼真，最狂的是連蟑螂卵鞘都不放過。（Instagram@9g_bbq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185602995140694016876053.jpeg/9_qPb6r6ww-cjNZYvkt-XLDUq8X-m2qQDBeu-QwXrvk\"/><figcaption>最近Threads上竟出現一款「蟑螂生日蛋糕」不只把小強還原得超逼真，最狂的是連蟑螂卵鞘都不放過。（Instagram@9g_bbq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"最近Threads上竟出現一款「蟑螂生日蛋糕」不只把小強還原得超逼真，最狂的是連蟑螂卵鞘都不放過。（Instagram@9g_bbq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185602997435109376586314.jpeg/5qyYpuKg8s6998QdnBoixuG8XGovwdb5jY6s5Y2OrOU\"/><figcaption>最近Threads上竟出現一款「蟑螂生日蛋糕」不只把小強還原得超逼真，最狂的是連蟑螂卵鞘都不放過。（Instagram@9g_bbq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有網民表示自己也是請這家蛋糕店做的蟑螂蛋糕。（threads@meng.425）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185602999796633600012698.jpeg/XB-_iOu3FFdNoroLavMINmy9H9uplaUPwXDeisFw3oo\"/><figcaption>有網民表示自己也是請這家蛋糕店做的蟑螂蛋糕。（threads@meng.425）</figcaption></figure><p>火鍋加芋頭輸了！他把蛋糕丟進皮蛋瘦肉粥 全家小編無奈：你開心就好</p><p>被標籤擋住…買好市多草莓蛋糕「15顆少2顆」 網揭2可能原因</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T02:20:31.846380+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2079,"images":19,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:00:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T02:37:40.164070+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T02:18:10.178710+00:00","content_hash":"49723e5e8ed0a3ef47fd207209e1176de67f760b25f3ae48b664f381f6a038c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}